{"pull": {"id": "number:18515", "number": 18515, "title": "KAFKA-17623: Flaky testSeekPositionAndPauseNewlyAssignedPartitionOnPartitionsAssignedCallback", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-01-14T00:27:53Z", "closed_at": "2025-01-16T21:02:23Z", "merged_at": "2025-01-16T21:02:23Z", "user": {"login": "kirktrue", "id": 92057, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjkyMDU3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92057?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue", "html_url": "https://github.com/kirktrue", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Update the logic to ensure that the `tp` partition is actually assigned (or revoked) to the `Consumer` before using it in the various `Consumer` API calls in the test.\r\n\r\nThe new consumer does not necessarily receive _all_ the partitions it's assigned in a single call to `onPartitionsAssigned()` (same with `onPartitionsRevoked()`). The test assumed that because it received _a_ call to `onPartitionsAssigned()` that means that call included _both_ partitions. That is _usually_ true, but not always.\r\n\r\n### Committer Checklist (excluded from commit message)\r\n- [ ] Verify design and implementation \r\n- [ ] Verify test coverage and CI build status\r\n- [ ] Verify documentation (including upgrade notes)\r\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 851033232, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzMyMzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/consumer", "name": "consumer", "color": "bf6a03", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 1257747426, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU3NzQ3NDI2", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/tests", "name": "tests", "color": "cfff60", "default": false, "description": "Test fixes (including flaky tests)", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 4771354362, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABHGUW-g", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-848", "name": "KIP-848", "color": "0E87F1", "default": false, "description": "The Next Generation of the Consumer Rebalance Protocol", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7491388177, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvoWDEQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/clients", "name": "clients", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18515"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_kirktrue_is_pr.json"}